message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
title: "fooddatacentral"
abstract: >-
  A Python module for obtaining information from the United States Department
  of Agriculture's Food Data Central database, which identifies foods by FDC
  number and reports their nutritional composition.  The module wraps the USDA
  API, handling lookup of foods by name or FDC identifier and returning
  nutritional information in a form convenient for analysis with pandas.
